<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent protests in Lagos saw demonstrators assault opposition supporters with chairs, while police opened a probe into a suspected cult killing in Imo and pursued the gunmen. Obi condemned the Lagos attack and demanded arrests, and his party issued a further call for prosecution of the perpetrators. Tinubu’s camp and Atiku continued to blame each other for the insecurity that has left 638 Nigerians killed in one month. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQeEZocDhmNF9JMUJJZUZJTEROelQ4bFBlR0RNX3hHR3ExeHlGYnJ3Nm1HR3lCc3FoNU0tTXJUTDM0Qi1zMTMtYU5DNEF1Q0xLZWQ3YlFNNlFlQ01naUFvbnNGZE80NXZBT01tVDh3TXFSVXc2RU4tVklaanFiTWF5a214X1c2ZExmUXBpVklRX2pxODg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPX0RHTTNBUy1ScjJ4ekxwUXpTclJDRGZKSGM4cVR0Rnl6Qmozby1YM213czh1X3VEeDIwVmN0d2x3cWxCMXV4N2NORTl1Q2NBMTlzYXd5SEp2MlFNbVpSQjV6RThSUFFvTXlFTGxqMzhvYnpselNGRzRyOU5BNTMydUZxckpqUnVyOVhF?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPRXl0bGNGR0tzcExjQnhpOEZVektucGhMOTYxSHNTelQ5dGktTmxZeV9jaHh2dGVTUF9HN2oxMndueVFyT0R4bF9uU09GMVpRUFIyM1FaMGJfZVVxTk9OM21BZG92bHktSmk1eXBzdlNUQ2tCMWZ1Z2gybmFKRnQ2V09rbEVXd0lJaTRMUk1RUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOb2xYNnBaTFZmOEc1UFZvR0tnV2RHUnJ2WGNCZ3VqU2VBMzNOaEktZjhUcF9XNlNaNDIydk9ZbU5zQnJhSGdhQ05ib1dHME50Qm9HeGhTWHJHYXpacm45QlZMaE5XVmF1LUJld3NIWnJwOEhKclNrOENTQTN0TDBXLWFrSzQ0RXM1cVhiWnprQ1hzNHVCLWhxN05OaG5vRW14ODhYVTZ4MDlVOWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/ar